# LaTeX build output and intermediates.
#
# Praxis: builds are out-of-source — latexmk writes everything to each manual's
# build/ subfolder (see latexmkrc: $out_dir = 'build'). The published PDFs live
# in static/manuals/ and are committed from there. So nothing under
# user_manual_latex/ should ever be tracked except the .tex sources, latexmkrc,
# build.sh and shared/.
#
# The patterns below also catch any stray intermediates that land next to a
# main.tex (e.g. from a one-off build that didn't pick up out_dir), so they
# never show up in `git status` again.

# Out-of-source build directories (one per manual)
build/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# latexmk
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex(busy)

# Core LaTeX intermediates
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.run.xml
*.idx
*.ind
*.ilg
*.glo
*.gls
*.glg
*.acn
*.acr
*.alg
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb
*.xdv
*.dvi
*.fmt

# Misc scratch / temp
*.tmp
